5
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,140
Would you like to meet in my office after lunch?

6
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,851
Woman: Later in the afternoon would be safer.

7
00:00:22,851 --> 00:00:27,500
I have a lunch-time meeting with our newest client today

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,290
and I don't know how long that's gonna last.
